{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892320/extras/bg.png?t=1749223693\" />\ud83e\ude96 <strong>Warfield Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warfield Heroes</strong> is a third-person online multiplayer shooter set in a stylized world inspired by World War II. Jump into fast-paced, arcade-style battles between two rival factions, where skill, vehicles, and humor make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Third-Person Shooter (TPS)</strong> gameplay focused on fun and accessibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cartoon-inspired graphics</strong>, delivering a unique and colorful visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully customizable heroes</strong>: skins, outfits, emotes, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pilot tanks, drive jeeps, and fly planes</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied stylized maps</strong> designed for fast yet tactical action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade-style combat</strong>: easy to learn, hard to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple. Strategic. Fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget realism \u2014 <strong>Warfield Heroes</strong> brings back the spirit of classic third-person shooters. Whether you're jumping in for a quick match or a long session with friends, this game delivers nonstop fun on every battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2892320?t=1749223693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892320/b12c541554fa1eb832e75e0864bfada8840504d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749223693","capsule_image":"https